/models/vae\n\n- https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/master/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors\n\n### ComfyUI/models/loras\n- https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Astro202/ComfyUI_Models/resolve/master/models/loras/krea2_turbo_4step_rank_64_lora_comfyui.safetensors"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 国内模型下载链接(备用)\n### ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models\n- https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/master/diffusion_models/krea2_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors\n\n### ComfyUI/models/text_encoders\n\n- https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/master/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n\n### ComfyUI/models/vae\n\n- https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/master/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors\n\n### ComfyUI/models/loras\n- https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Astro202/ComfyUI_Models/resolve/master/models/loras/krea2_turbo_4step_rank_64_lora_comfyui.safetensors"},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":4,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[140,230],"size":[390,400],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":11},{"localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"条件","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","slot_index":0,"links":[4,5]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.34.0","Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode"},"widgets_values":["三维数字艺术渲染，超写实风格，年轻女性角色展示图，采用三视图构图：左侧为全身正面动态姿势，中间为背面侧面全身照，右侧为面部特写。角色拥有黑色长卷发，扎成双马尾，发间装饰着小小的粉色毛绒小熊发夹，头顶夹着一个粉红边框的墨镜。她身穿白色宽松的短袖T恤，T恤胸前位置印有“MiniMax”字样的黑色哥特风格文字，下身搭配蓝色水洗紧身牛仔超短裤，裤腰挂着一个可爱的 Hello Kitty 形象毛绒挂件。脚穿白色厚底运动鞋，搭配白色中筒袜。画面背景为纯灰色，整体氛围青春时尚、甜美可爱，细节清晰锐利。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"三维数字艺术渲染，超写实风格，年轻女性角色展示图，采用三视图构图：左侧为全身正面动态姿势，中间为背面侧面全身照，右侧为面部特写。角色拥有黑色长卷发，扎成双马尾，发间装饰着小小的粉色毛绒小熊发夹，头顶夹着一个粉红边框的墨镜。她身穿白色宽松的短袖T恤，T恤胸前位置印有“MiniMax”字样的黑色哥特风格文字，下身搭配蓝色水洗紧身牛仔超短裤，裤腰挂着一个可爱的 Hello Kitty 形象毛绒挂件。脚穿白色厚底运动鞋，搭配白色中筒袜。画面背景为纯灰色，整体氛围青春时尚、甜美可爱，细节清晰锐利。"}},{"id":11,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-290,810],"size":[390,270],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["## Krea 2 Turbo — 4-step distillation LoRA\n\nKrea 2 Turbo normally needs **8 steps**. With this LoRA it runs at **4**.\n\n### Files\n| file | put it in |\n| --- | --- |\n| `krea2_turbo_bf16.safetensors` | `models/diffusion_models/` |\n| `qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors` | `models/text_encoders/` |\n| `qwen_image_vae.safetensors` | `models/vae/` |\n| `krea2_turbo_4step_rank_64_lora_comfyui.safetensors` | `models/loras/` |\n\nThe first three are from [Comfy-Org/Krea-2](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2).\n\n**The LoRA is independent of the base build.** It is applied on top of the diffusion model by ComfyUI's own loader, which handles any dequantisation, so a quantised or otherwise optimised build of Krea 2 Turbo behaves just as bf16 does. Please use whichever variant suits your hardware — set it in **Load Diffusion Model** and leave the rest of the workflow untouched.\n\nThis workflow ships **full bf16** only because it is the one build guaranteed to run everywhere: bf16 needs no backend-specific kernel, so it works on CUDA, Apple Silicon and CPU alike. Smaller options: `krea2_turbo_int8_convrot` (13.5 GB, either platform), or `krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled` (13.1 GB) which is **NVIDIA-only** — MPS has no `Float8_e4m3fn` support and fails at the sampler. The text encoder has bf16 and fp8 builds only; there is no int8 one.\n\n> **Do not use `fp8_scaled` on Apple Silicon.** MPS has no `Float8_e4m3fn` support, so it fails at the sampler with *\"Trying to convert Float8_e4m3fn to the MPS backend\"*. It is fine on NVIDIA. `krea2_turbo_bf16` (26.3 GB) also works everywhere if you prefer full precision — just set the matching name in the loader.\n\n### Settings that matter\n- **steps 4**, **cfg 1.0** (Turbo is CFG-free), sampler **euler**, scheduler **simple**\n- LoRA strength **1.0**\n- The negative is a `ConditioningZeroOut` — at cfg 1.0 it is not evaluated, so there is nothing to write in it\n\nSet steps back to 8 and bypass the LoRA node (Ctrl+B) to compare against stock Turbo.\n\n### Metadata\nThe LoRA file carries its training details in its safetensors metadata: base model, method, sample count and the inference settings above."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## Krea 2 Turbo — 4-step distillation LoRA\n\nKrea 2 Turbo normally needs **8 steps**. With this LoRA it runs at **4**.\n\n### Files\n| file | put it in |\n| --- | --- |\n| `krea2_turbo_bf16.safetensors` | `models/diffusion_models/` |\n| `qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors` | `models/text_encoders/` |\n| `qwen_image_vae.safetensors` | `models/vae/` |\n| `krea2_turbo_4step_rank_64_lora_comfyui.safetensors` | `models/loras/` |\n\nThe first three are from [Comfy-Org/Krea-2](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2).\n\n**The LoRA is independent of the base build.** It is applied on top of the diffusion model by ComfyUI's own loader, which handles any dequantisation, so a quantised or otherwise optimised build of Krea 2 Turbo behaves just as bf16 does. Please use whichever variant suits your hardware — set it in **Load Diffusion Model** and leave the rest of the workflow untouched.\n\nThis workflow ships **full bf16** only because it is the one build guaranteed to run everywhere: bf16 needs no backend-specific kernel, so it works on CUDA, Apple Silicon and CPU alike. Smaller options: `krea2_turbo_int8_convrot` (13.5 GB, either platform), or `krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled` (13.1 GB) which is **NVIDIA-only** — MPS has no `Float8_e4m3fn` support and fails at the sampler. The text encoder has bf16 and fp8 builds only; there is no int8 one.\n\n> **Do not use `fp8_scaled` on Apple Silicon.** MPS has no `Float8_e4m3fn` support, so it fails at the sampler with *\"Trying to convert Float8_e4m3fn to the MPS backend\"*. It is fine on NVIDIA. `krea2_turbo_bf16` (26.3 GB) also works everywhere if you prefer full precision — just set the matching name in the loader.\n\n### Settings that matter\n- **steps 4**, **cfg 1.0** (Turbo is CFG-free), sampler **euler**, scheduler **simple**\n- LoRA strength **1.0**\n- The negative is a `ConditioningZeroOut` — at cfg 1.0 it is not evaluated, so there is nothing to write in it\n\nSet steps back to 8 and bypass the LoRA node (Ctrl+B) to compare against stock Turbo.\n\n### Metadata\nThe LoRA file carries its training details in its safetensors metadata: base model, method, sample count and the inference settings above."},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":27,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1200,70],"size":[460,430],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{}},"widgets_values":["# 🍔 [ComfyUI应用版](https://www.autodl.art/app/market?app=58&v=79) 直接运行即可\n---\n## 🪗 镜像版 [ComfyUI/2024](https://www.autodl.art/i/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/ComfyUI_2024) 没有内置模型，需要另外下载工作流模型:\n- ✨【工作流】Krea2_turbo_4step_文生图0910\n- ✨【工作流】SeedVR2-高清放大\n### 具体下载方法见 -> [如何下载常用模型](https://kcnxcv04ekgp.feishu.cn/wiki/HV6HwtezMijfLZkNXDcc8gfPnrg)\n---\n### 旧镜像可能要更新 ComfyUI 才能使用👉 [如何更新 ComfyUI](https://my.feishu.cn/wiki/PwtFwFLfYiKRP7kEkSacDPh1n7g) "],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"# 🍔 [ComfyUI应用版](https://www.autodl.art/app/market?app=58&v=79) 直接运行即可\n---\n## 🪗 镜像版 [ComfyUI/2024](https://www.autodl.art/i/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/ComfyUI_2024) 没有内置模型，需要另外下载工作流模型:\n- ✨【工作流】Krea2_turbo_4step_文生图0910\n- ✨【工作流】SeedVR2-高清放大\n### 具体下载方法见 -> [如何下载常用模型](https://kcnxcv04ekgp.feishu.cn/wiki/HV6HwtezMijfLZkNXDcc8gfPnrg)\n---\n### 旧镜像可能要更新 ComfyUI 才能使用👉 [如何更新 ComfyUI](https://my.feishu.cn/wiki/PwtFwFLfYiKRP7kEkSacDPh1n7g) "},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":28,"type":"SeedVR2LoadDiTModel","pos":[590,800],"size":[400,210],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"torch编译参数","localized_name":"torch编译参数","name":"torch_compile_args","shape":7,"type":"TORCH_COMPILE_ARGS","link":null},{"label":"模型","localized_name":"模型","name":"model","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"model"},"link":null},{"lab